# What Vercel does NOT need to build the website.
#
# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `website`, but deploys must be made from
# the REPO ROOT so the workspace package `@verdure/decider` — which website/ now
# imports instead of carrying its own copy — is present to resolve. That means
# the whole monorepo is the upload context, including 2.6 GB of Rust build
# output. Hence this file.
#
# Keep: website/, packages/decider/, and the root workspace manifests.

# Rust build artifacts — by far the largest thing here.
app/src-tauri/target/
target/

# Desktop app bits irrelevant to the website build.
app/dist/
app/src-tauri/gen/
app/screenshots/
app/src-tauri/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

# Local build/test output.
website/.next/
**/node_modules/
screenshots/
